  "project_description": "Synopsis \n Group Membership Request module extends Group module. It allows users to request a membership to a group and managers (administrators) to approve these requests.\n\n Requirements \n \n Group \n State machine \n \n Group request Membership 2.0 \n This version is based on Group 2.0, which provides upgrade path.\n\nGroupContentEnabler plugin was replace with GroupRelationship plugin.\n\nThe rest of the module works as before.\n\nIt is the first step for migration to Group 3.0.\n\n Group request Membership 3.0 \n This version is based on Group 3.0.\n\n Credits \n Lobachev Nikolay \n\n Back to top",
